<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS - Australia consumer confidence rising - Costello.</title>
<headline>RTRS - Australia consumer confidence rising - Costello.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Treasurer Peter Costello said on Monday consumer confidence in Australia had risen sharply after recent interest rate cuts under the new coalition government.</p>
<p>&quot;There has been a sharp rise in consumer confidence,&quot; Costello told parliament.</p>
</text>
